            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I am grateful for your aid, Wizard. I have been a prisoner in my own mind for days on end because of that snake-in-the-grass.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ShakaZebu_ZFA_03.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 465390,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "ZF-ZAM-NPC15_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Long ago, each of the four tribes was charged with holding back the darkness by Merle Ambrose and the Council of Light.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ShakaZebu_ZFA_04.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 465390,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "ZF-ZAM-NPC15_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "We were each given a sacred artifact: Golden Shield, Crown, Swords, and Amulet.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ShakaZebu_ZFA_05.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 465390,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "ZF-ZAM-NPC15_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I do not know what evil Tse-Tse plots with the Umbra Queen, but they have our Shield and the Lions' Crown.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ShakaZebu_ZFA_06.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 465390,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "ZF-ZAM-NPC15_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I know Tse-Tse will go after the Elephants' Golden Swords next, for I am a military genius.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ShakaZebu_ZFA_07.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 465390,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "ZF-ZAM-NPC15_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Tell my glorious wife Queen Amahle the spirals are gone from my eyes. She will help you reach the Elephants.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_ZF|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ShakaZebu_ZFA_08.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
